# 逆向工具链 — 规则（配合 SignLab.js / RespInspector.js / AdBlock.js / VipPatch.js 使用）

[rewrite_local]
https?:\/\/ url script-request-header https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vincent-ou/QuantumultX/main/XiaoMao/SignLab.js
https?:\/\/ url script-response-body https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vincent-ou/QuantumultX/main/XiaoMao/RespInspector.js
https?:\/\/ url script-response-body https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vincent-ou/QuantumultX/main/XiaoMao/AdBlock.js
https?:\/\/ url script-response-body https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vincent-ou/QuantumultX/main/XiaoMao/VipPatch.js

[mitm]
hostname = *
